<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id">YÔN - Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">Yôn</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yônà</para>
  <para style="toc1">YÔNÀ</para>
  <para style="h">Yônà</para>
  <para style="mt1">YÔNÀ</para>
  <para style="imt1">Enshokolezi</para>
  <para style="ip">Ecitabu ca Yônà cimanyisa akalamo k’omulêbi Yônà wali mwabiranyi. Burhanzi alonza okuleka omukolo gwâge na buzinda avuga Nyamuzinda omunkwa bulya omukolo gwâge gwâgezire bwinjà.</para>
  <para style="ip">Eci citabu cilonza Yônà abè lwîganyo kuli Israheli walahiraga okuyunjuza omukolo gwâge gw’okuyigîriza amashanja g’abapagani Akanwa ka Nnâmahanga. Eci citabu cirhuyêresire muntu muguma waderhagwa Yônà, Nyamuzinda arhumaga mpu abè mwigîriza omu cishagala cinene c’abapagani ciderhwa Ninive. Yônà alahira okujira ogwo mukolo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Amashanja g’abapagani gayishihamagalwa na Nnâmahanga lyo gacungulwa. Ab’omu Ninive, abayishirhenga omu bugoma n’okuhungama ebyâha byâbo bali lwîganyo lw’amashanja g’abapagani gayishigalukira Nyamuzinda w’okuli.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yônà agaywa na Nyamuzinda. Ci kwône amuhà olwiganyo lw’omurhi gumera n’okuyûma duba duba, lyo akengêra obwonjo bunene bwa Nnâmahanga.</para>
  <para style="iot">EBIRIMWO</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Okuhamagalwa kwa Yônà n’okushenga kwâge: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 1:1-2:11">1, 1—2, 11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Okuhongoka kwa Ninive n’obwonjo bwa Nnâmahanga: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 3:1-10">3, 1-10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Okucîduduma kwa Yônà n’ishuzo lya Nnâmahanga: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 4:1-11">4, 1-11</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JON 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Yônà àrhenguha omukolo gwâge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 1:1"/>Akanwa ka Nnâmahanga kanacirhindakwo Yônà mwene Amitayi, erhi: <verse eid="JON 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 1:2"/>«Yimuka, ojè e Ninive, cishagala cinene, obabwîre oku obubî bwâbo bwahisire emunda ndi». <verse eid="JON 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 1:3"/>Yônà ayimuka, àgwârha enjira, y’okuyâkira Nnâmahanga erhali hôfi, e Tarsisi. Anaciyandagalira e Yope, àbugâna obwârho bwajà e Tarsisi; abahyulira enjira, ajà omu bwârho boshi nabo kuhika e Tarsisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yônà ayâsire bulya arhalisimire Nnâmahanga abêre abantu b’e Ninive obwonjo. Obu bulêbi bwoshi bwalonza okurhuyigîriza oku ngasi muntu yêshi oyêmera Nnâmahanga n’okuciyuûnjuza ebyâha byâge, Nyamuzinda anamubêre obwonjo. Yônà yêhe alimanyire mpu erhi ankajà e Tarsisi, Nnâmahanga arhankacimubandâna, arhankanacimurhuma mpu ajiyigîriza e Ninive. - «Tarsisi»; emw’Abahebraniya kuli kuderha «ebuhwero bw’igulu».</char></note>, kulî na Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="JON 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 1:4"/>Ci Nnâmahanga azûsa omuhûsi n’omulaba munene omu nyanja, ciru obwârho bwalinzitwîkamwo. <verse eid="JON 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 1:5"/>Abashâna bagera­ mwo omusisi, ngasi muguma acikumba omuzimu w’emwâbo, bànarhogeza emishoko yâbo omu nyanja mpu lyo bayanguha. Ci larha wâni Yônà erhi anayandagalîre aha nteberhebe y’obwârho, agwîshîre, aj’îrò. <verse eid="JON 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 1:6"/>Omukulu w’o­ bwârho anacimuyegêra, amuzûsa, amubwîra erhi: «Cirhumire ogweshîre? Zûka, ocîkumbe Nyamuzinda wâwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">5-6: Abo bashâna bàkâgiharâmya ba-nyamuzinda b’obwîhambi. Yônà, yeki, àkàgiharâmya Nyamuzinda w’okuli: Nyamubâho.</char></note>. Nkaba Nyamuzinda arhukengêra, rhurhagifà.» <verse eid="JON 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 1:7"/>Okubundi babwîrana, mpu: «Rhuyeshe ecigole, lyo rhumanya ndi odwîrhe obu buhanya». Bàyesha ecigole, n’ecigole cagwârha Yônà. <verse eid="JON 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 1:8"/>Okubundi bàmubwîra, mpu: «Rhubwîre ihanja lici olikwo, ngahi warhenga, oli wa ngahi, oli wa mulala muci?» Anacibashuza, erhi: <verse eid="JON 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 1:9"/>«Ndi Muyahudi, Nyamuzinda mparâmya, Lulema w’empingu n’igulu, owalemaga enyanja n’obudaka.»<verse eid="JON 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 1:10"/>Aho, abashâna bayôboha, bamudôsa, mpu: «Bici ebyo wajizire!» Balikola bamanyire oku kuyâka ajayâka Nyamuzinda, bulya àli erhi amabarhondêreza emyanzi yâge. <verse eid="JON 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 1:11"/>Bàmudôsa, mpu: «Kurhi rhwakujiraga obwo lyo eyi nyanja erhûla?» Bulya amîshi gàlikola gali gayimukanana kulusha. <verse eid="JON 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JON 1:12"/>Abashuza, erhi: «Muntôle, munkwêbe omu nyanja, lyo enyanja erhûza. Bulya mmanyire oku nie ntumire ogu mulaba munene gwazûka.» <verse eid="JON 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JON 1:13"/>Abashâna bavugama obwârho mpu bajè oku burhambi; ci kwabà kurhamira busha, bulya enyanja erhazigaga bayîsa, emivumba yaluga kulusha. <verse eid="JON 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JON 1:14"/>Okubundi bashenga Nyamuzinda, baderha, mpu: «Waliha Nyamuzinda, kurhi rhwankafulumuka olufù-nyanja rhulekifà enyanya ly’oyu muntu! Orharhubarhuzagya empanga nyêru-kwêru, bulya wêne, we Nyamuzinda, oku olonzize kwo onajira.» <verse eid="JON 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JON 1:15"/>Bàgwârha Yônà, bamukwêba omu nyanja, okuhandi enyanja yarhûza. <verse eid="JON 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JON 1:16"/>Abo bantu banacirhungwa n’obwôba embere za Nyamuzinda, bamurherekêra enterekêro banahiga emi­gabo.<verse eid="JON 1:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JON 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yônà àcunguka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 2:1"/>Nnâmahanga anacirhuma omufi munênênè, amirangusa Yônà. Yônà àjira nsiku isharhu na madufu asharhu omu nda y’enfî. <verse eid="JON 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 2:2"/>Mw’eyo nda y’enfî, Yônà ayâkûza Nnâmahanga Nyamuzinda wâge, aderha, erhi:<verse eid="JON 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 2:3"/>Amango nalihanyagire, nayakûzize Nyamuzinda, ananshuza. Amango nali ekuzimu, nayakûzize, wanayumva izù lyâni.<verse eid="JON 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 2:4"/>Walinkwêbire omu ntuli, omu muhengere gw’enyanja, emivumba y’enyanya yàlingosire. Emilala yâwe yoshi n’endimi zâwe byanyandagalira­kwo.<verse eid="JON 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 2:5"/>Go mango nadesire, nti: «Namarhenga omu masù gâwe, kurhigi nacilolêreze akà-Nyamuzinda kâwe kimâna?»<verse eid="JON 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 2:6"/>Amîshi galingosire kuhika emumiro, entuli yalingosire, emihulula y’erwîshi yalinfukafusire irhwe.<verse eid="JON 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 2:7"/>Emuhengere nalinyadagalîre, nahamikirwa ekuzimu. Ci kurhenga omu bulumba washubinyinamula, Nnâmahanga Nyamuzinda wâni.<verse eid="JON 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 2:8"/>Oku omurhima gwâni guli gwashûbuka nakengêra Nyamuzinda, n’omusengero gwâni gwahika emunda oli, omu burhwâli bwâwe bwimâna.<verse eid="JON 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 2:9"/>Bala barherekêra abazimu, bône bacihegeza iragi lyâbo.<verse eid="JON 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 2:10"/>Ci niehe kuyimba nâyimba omwîshingo gwâni, nâyunjuliza ebiragâne nakujirîre. Bulya we Nyakasane Muciza wâni.<verse eid="JON 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 2:11"/>Buzinda Nnâmahanga arhegeka wanfî okugendishalira Yônà oku cikwi c’enyanja.<verse eid="JON 2:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JON 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Ab’e Ninive bàciyûnjuza na Nyamuzinda àbababalira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 3:1"/>Akanwa ka Nnâmahanga kanacirhindakwo Yônà obwa kabirhi, erhi: <verse eid="JON 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 3:2"/>«Yimuka, ojè e Ninive, cishagala cinene, obabwîre ebi nîkubwîra.» <verse eid="JON 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 3:3"/>Yônà anaciyimuka, ajà e Ninive nk’oku Nnâmahanga analidesire. Omanyage oku Ninive ali munene: olurhali lugendo lwa nsiku isharhu lurhankarhumire omuntu amuyûsa amugeramwo. <verse eid="JON 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 3:4"/>Yônà anacihira njira, alambagira omulegerege gwoshi. Akajahamagaza n’okuderha, erhi: «Hacisigîre nsiku makumi anni, Ninive ahongoke.» <verse eid="JON 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 3:5"/>Engabo ya Ninive yanaciyêmêra Nnâmahanga, yahuluza n’okulâlika okucîshalisa, yanayambala sunzu, kurhenga oku mukulu kuhika oku murhò. <verse eid="JON 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 3:6"/>Omwanzi gwahikakwo mwâmi w’e Ninive, azikûka oku ntebe yâge, ahogola ecishâli câge, acîbwîka sunzu, acîbwâlika n’omu luvù<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">5-6: Ebyo binwa birhuyêresire okurhashushana kwa bene Israheli barhaciyunjuzagya n’abantu b’e Ninive. Bôhe bacîyunjuzize amango bayumvagya enyigîrizo za Yônà. Okuyambala sunzu n’okuciîbwâlika omu luvù: cimanyîso ca buciyûnjuze.</char></note>. <verse eid="JON 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 3:7"/>Okuhandi balâlika muli Ninive yêshi, oku irhegeko lya mwâmi haguma n’abarhambo, mpu: «Abantu boshi, n’ebintu ntâye okozagye amîshi erhi biryo ekanwa. <verse eid="JON 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 3:8"/>Muyambale sunzu, muharâmye munashenge Nyamuzinda obwonjo oku byâha binyu, muleke okuhimba kwinyu kubî, muleke ebigalugalu by’amaboko ginyu. <verse eid="JON 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 3:9"/>Ndi omanyire erhi Nnâmahanga arhankashukira ashube okuboko, aleke obukunizi bwâge arhuyôkole?» <verse eid="JON 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 3:10"/>Nnâmahanga abona oku badwîrhe batabataba mpu lyo bahindula engeso zâbo. Lêro ashukira, arhacibarhumiraga obuhanya àli amâhiga oku âbarhumira.<verse eid="JON 3:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JON 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Ecifufu ca Yônà n’ishuzo lya Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 4:1"/>Erhi Nnâmahanga àbà amâbabalira Ninive, ebyo byashologorha Yônà hôfi kucîniga n’oburhè. <verse eid="JON 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 4:2"/>Anaciyâkûza, erhi: «Ntarhenga omu iderhero, waliha! K’arhali birya naderhaga erhi nciri omu cihugo cîrhu ebi! Co cànarhumaga ncîlibirhira kuhika e Tarsisi, bulya nalinyôsire mmanyire oku we Nyamuzinda w’obwonjo n’ow’olukogo, orharukûza, we mugale mwimâna, Orhakwîrirwa bubî. <verse eid="JON 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 4:3"/>Mâshi Yâgirwa, mpêka buno, yanka guno mûka, bulya olufù lwo lukulu aha kalamo emwâni buno». <verse eid="JON 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 4:4"/>Nnâmahanga amushuza erhi: «Cici cirhumire wakaliha okungan’aho?» <verse eid="JON 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 4:5"/>Yônà arhenga muli cirya cishagala, aciyungulira ebushoshôkero bw’izûba, ayûbakayo ecifumba, adêkerera, alingûsa ebyâbà omu cishagala. <verse eid="JON 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 4:6"/>Okuhandi, Nnâmahanga àmumezaho olubonobono, lwakula, lwakâmujirira ecîhôho, lwakâmucikirira omu malibuko. Yônà asîma bwenêne olwo lubonobono. <verse eid="JON 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 4:7"/>Ci kwône erhi bugendica sêzi, lukula arhanda, Nnâmahanga àgeza shumbwe muli lulya lubonobono, lwanaciyûma. <verse eid="JON 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 4:8"/>E­erhi izûba lishoshôka, Nyamuzinda azûsa empûsi yâyôca, lirya izûba lyabasha­ kwo Yônà, okuhandi ajogonokerwa. Kandi acîfinja olufù, aderha, erhi: «Aye! Okufà kwo kukulu aha kulama ntya». <verse eid="JON 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 4:9"/>Nnâmahanga àmushuza, erhi: «Cankarhuma wadwîra omu nda nk’ihiri, olwo lubonobono obêrîre burhè, ka lwâwe?» Naye, erhi: «Yâgirwa, kurhi ntankabà burhè mâshi!» <verse eid="JON 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 4:10"/>Nnâmahanga ashubîrira, amubwîra, erhi: «W’oyu, olubonobono orhakoleraga, orhanaluyuhiriraga, luli lwakuvuna, budufu buguma lwameraga, budufu buguma lwayumire. <verse eid="JON 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 4:11"/>Nâni nie obwînage oku ntankafà mungo kuli Ninive, ecishagala cinene cirimwo bihumbi igana na makumi abirhi, ciru na kulusha, ga bantu barhishi okulyo kwâbo, barhishi okulembe kwâbo, cirimwo n’obusò bw’ebintu!»<verse eid="JON 4:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 4"/>
</usx>
